{"ref":"BDB, חָרִיץ","hw":"חָרִיץ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חָרִיץ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.18\">1 S 17:18</a></sup> <strong>a cut, thing cut, sharp instrument</strong>;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרִיצֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.18\">1 S 17:18</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.3\">1 Ch 20:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרִצֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.31\">2 S 12:31</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הֶחָלָב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.18\">1 S 17:18</a> <em>cuts of milk</em> i. e. cheeses.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>sharp instr.</em> of iron, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.31\">2 S 12:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.3\">1 Ch 20:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּמְּגֵרָה ובח׳ הַבַּרְזֶל וּבַמְּגֵרוֹת</span> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:3\" href=\"/Amos.1.3\">Am 1:3</a> sub <span dir=\"rtl\">חרוץ</span> <strong>1</strong>, and Dr<sup>Sm</sup>).","next":"BDB, חַרְצַנִּים","prev":"BDB, חָרוּץ⁴"}